01:20:16.900 --> 01:20:20.830
And since 2013, we've been
collaborating regularly.

01:20:20.830 --> 01:20:22.970
And it's been one of the
greatest joys of my life.

01:20:22.970 --> 01:20:25.480
This is an amazing
musician in person.

01:20:25.480 --> 01:20:27.970
And we're so thankful
to have him here.

01:20:27.970 --> 01:20:32.100
