01:20:35.320 --> 01:20:40.290
on sound, Tony Debartolo
back there recording.

01:20:40.290 --> 01:20:43.770
The people of Puerto Rico-- my
goodness, you have inspired me.

01:20:43.770 --> 01:20:46.210
And you will continue
to inspire me.

01:20:46.210 --> 01:20:47.340
Thank you very much.

01:20:47.340 --> 01:20:51.290
