01:21:21.420 --> 01:21:23.772
But I want to
acknowledge again Evan,

01:21:23.772 --> 01:21:25.230
who is the chair
of our department,

01:21:25.230 --> 01:21:28.500
Evan Ziporyn, and also the head
of cast at the Center of Arts

01:21:28.500 --> 01:21:31.800
and Science and Technology
and a world-class player

01:21:31.800 --> 01:21:35.490
and to have this person as
a colleague year after year.

01:21:35.490 --> 01:21:38.430
I think we collaborate
constantly because we cannot

01:21:38.430 --> 01:21:39.460
not do that.

01:21:39.460 --> 01:21:40.608
So it's been fantastic.

01:21:40.608 --> 01:21:41.400
So thank you, Evan.

01:21:41.400 --> 01:21:46.350
